# Logs
# *.log alone misses RotatingFileHandler's backups (bot.log.1, bot.log.2, ...),
# which hold the OLDER history: user message content, uploaded-file text and
# unredacted exception text. Ignore the whole logs/ tree, and rotated names
# anywhere else.
*.log
*.log.[0-9]*
logs/

