# The services mkdir this on demand, so no tracked placeholder is needed.
# A "!data/.gitkeep" negation used to sit here and could never fire: git does
# not descend into an excluded directory, so a rule re-including a child of
# "data/" is dead.
data/

# Misc
*.pid

